%
(TCPC servo tune: combined XYZBC motion)
(No probing. No tool installed. Exercises XYZ acceleration during TCPC B/C motion.)

G17 G21 G40 G49 G54 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G92.1 G94

o<preview_guard> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
  (DEBUG, TCPC_SERVO_TUNE_TCPC_XYZBC_MOTION preview only)
  M2
o<preview_guard> endif

o<tool_zero_check> if [#<_current_tool> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC XYZBC tune requires tool 0 and no tool installed)
o<tool_zero_check> endif
o<tlo_x_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.x]>] GT 0.001]
  (abort, TCPC XYZBC tune requires zero active X tool offset)
o<tlo_x_check> endif
o<tlo_y_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.y]>] GT 0.001]
  (abort, TCPC XYZBC tune requires zero active Y tool offset)
o<tlo_y_check> endif
o<tlo_z_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[motion.tooloffset.z]>] GT 0.001]
  (abort, TCPC XYZBC tune requires zero active Z tool offset)
o<tlo_z_check> endif
o<tcpc_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC XYZBC tune must start with TCPC off)
o<tcpc_off_check> endif
o<twp_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.motion_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC XYZBC tune must start with TWP motion off)
o<twp_off_check> endif
o<b_zero_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[headheadtwp.current_joint_b]>] GT 0.05]
  (abort, TCPC XYZBC tune must start near B0)
o<b_zero_check> endif
o<c_zero_check> if [ABS[#<_hal[headheadtwp.current_joint_c]>] GT 0.05]
  (abort, TCPC XYZBC tune must start near C0)
o<c_zero_check> endif

(MSG, Confirm no tool installed and clearance for X/Y +/-30mm, Z +/-8mm, B +/-30deg, C +/-90deg)
M0

G0 B0.0 C0.0

#<start_x> = #<_x>
#<start_y> = #<_y>
#<start_z> = #<_z>

G43.4
o<tcpc_on_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> LT 0.5]
  (abort, G43.4 did not enable TCPC)
o<tcpc_on_check> endif

(Stage 1: conservative combined XYZBC motion.)
F1200
G1 X[#<start_x> + 20.0] Y[#<start_y>]        Z[#<start_z>]        B15.0  C30.0
G1 X[#<start_x> + 20.0] Y[#<start_y> + 20.0] Z[#<start_z> + 5.0]  B-15.0 C60.0
G1 X[#<start_x>]        Y[#<start_y>]        Z[#<start_z>]        B0.0   C0.0
M0 (Stage 1 complete: F1200)

(Stage 2: moderate combined XYZBC motion.)
F3000
G1 X[#<start_x> - 25.0] Y[#<start_y>]        Z[#<start_z> - 5.0]  B30.0  C-90.0
G1 X[#<start_x> + 25.0] Y[#<start_y> - 25.0] Z[#<start_z> + 5.0]  B-30.0 C90.0
G1 X[#<start_x>]        Y[#<start_y>]        Z[#<start_z>]        B0.0   C0.0
M0 (Stage 2 complete: F3000)

(Stage 3: faster combined XYZBC motion within current TCPC config limits.)
F6000
G1 X[#<start_x> + 30.0] Y[#<start_y> + 20.0] Z[#<start_z>]        B30.0  C90.0
G1 X[#<start_x> - 30.0] Y[#<start_y> - 20.0] Z[#<start_z>]        B-30.0 C-90.0
G1 X[#<start_x> + 30.0] Y[#<start_y> - 20.0] Z[#<start_z> + 8.0]  B30.0  C-90.0
G1 X[#<start_x> - 30.0] Y[#<start_y> + 20.0] Z[#<start_z> - 8.0]  B-30.0 C90.0
G1 X[#<start_x>]        Y[#<start_y>]        Z[#<start_z>]        B0.0   C0.0
M0 (Back at TCPC entry orientation after F6000 stage)

G49.1
o<tcpc_off_end_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, G49.1 did not disable TCPC)
o<tcpc_off_end_check> endif
o<twp_off_end_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.motion_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, G49.1 left TWP motion enabled)
o<twp_off_end_check> endif

(DEBUG, TCPC_SERVO_TUNE_TCPC_XYZBC_MOTION complete)
M30
%
